   Livingston, Steven, George Washington Univ GW, Inst Data Democracy \& Polit, Washington, DC 20052 USA.
   Livingston, Steven, George Washington Univ, Elliott Sch Int Affairs, Illiberal Studies Program, Washington, DC 20052 USA.},
